      "claim": "There is no documented evidence that Minnoch exhibited the core psychological features of anorexia nervosa (fear of weight gain, body‑image distortion) or intentional food restriction; reports describe hyperphagia.",
      "evidence": "Case reports and interviews with his physicians note excessive eating and lack of body‑image concerns.",
